VectorPeak (VectorPeak) Jun 30, 2026

There isn't a supported switch to make current vcpkg use Windows PowerShell 5.1 instead of `pwsh` for this path. The dialog in the screenshot is `pwsh.exe` itself crashing with “Unknown Hard Error”, so vcpkg never gets far enough to use it. One thing to change: don't set the host triplet to MinGW unless you specifically need host tools built with MinGW. Use MinGW only for the target packages:

    $env:VCPKG_DEFAULT_TRIPLET="x64-mingw-static"
    Remove-Item Env:VCPKG_DEFAULT_HOST_TRIPLET -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue
